# Fragment: mc_support.chunk00001.ttl
# Classes
hpc:BaseBoard a owl:Class .
hpc:LDom a owl:Class .
hpc:Socket a owl:Class .
hpc:Core a owl:Class .
hpc:Thread a owl:Class .
hpc:CPU a owl:Class .
hpc:Affinity a owl:Class .
hpc:AffinityMask a owl:Class .
hpc:FatMasks a owl:Class .

# Object Properties
hpc:hasAffinity a owl:ObjectProperty .
hpc:hasAffinityMask a owl:ObjectProperty .

# Datatype Properties
hpc:isMotherboard a owl:DatatypeProperty .
hpc:isNUMADomain a owl:DatatypeProperty .
hpc:isSocket a owl:DatatypeProperty .
hpc:isCore a owl:DatatypeProperty .
hpc:isThread a owl:DatatypeProperty .
hpc:isCPU a owl:DatatypeProperty .
hpc:isAffinity a owl:DatatypeProperty .
hpc:isAffinityMask a owl:DatatypeProperty .
hpc:isFatMasks a owl:DatatypeProperty .

# Subclass relations
hpc:CPU rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Class ; owl:unionOf (hpc:Core hpc:Thread) ] .

# Domain and Range
hpc:hasAffinity rdfs:domain hpc:CPU ;
    rdfs:range hpc:Affinity .
hpc:hasAffinityMask rdfs:domain hpc:CPU ;
    rdfs:range hpc:AffinityMask .
```

This ontology fragment describes the classes for the Slurm Workload Manager's multi-core/multi-thread architecture, including BaseBoard, LDom, Socket, Core, Thread, CPU, Affinity, AffinityMask, and FatMasks. It also defines object properties for hasAffinity and hasAffinityMask, and datatype properties for isMotherboard, isNUMADomain, isSocket, isCore, isThread, isCPU, isAffinity, isAffinityMask, and isFatMasks. The ontology also includes subclass relations and domain and range declarations for the properties.

