           hpc:CPU_Bind "0x08" .
hpc:p30x40 a hpc:TaskID ;
           hpc:CPU_Bind "0x80" .
```

This ontology fragment represents the classes `Node`, `Socket`, `Core`, `Thread`, and `TaskID`, as well as the `CPU_Bind` object property that connects a `TaskID` to its CPU binding string. The given task IDs and their CPU bindings are also included as instances of the `TaskID` class.

