This ontology fragment represents the classes `SlurmJob`, `PostResponse`, `DeleteResponse`, `GetResponse`, and `JobInfoResponse`. It also defines the object properties `hasContent`, `contentSchema`, and `contentSchemaRef`. The `hasContent` property represents the response content of a Slurm job, while `contentSchema` and `contentSchemaRef` are used to specify the schema of the response content.

