This ontology fragment defines classes for Job, Partition, and Node, as well as properties for each class. The properties include jobID, partition, state, time, user, nodes, nodeList, partitionName, nodes, default, overSubscribe, priorityTier, and preemptMode. The properties are defined as datatype or object properties, and their domains and ranges are specified.

