hpc:SlurmWorkloadManager a owl:Class .
hpc:SchedMD a owl:Class .

hpc:Topology a owl:Class .
hpc:ThreeDimensionalTopology a hpc:Topology .
hpc:TreeTopology a hpc:Topology .
