```

This ontology fragment represents the classes and properties related to the Slurm Workload Manager, specifically focusing on the topology-aware resource allocation. It includes classes for Slurm Workload Manager, SchedMD, Topology, ThreeDimensionalTopology, TreeTopology, BlockTopology, Switch, and Node. It also includes object properties for relationships such as having a topology, having a switch, having nodes, having children, and having a parent switch. Additionally, it includes a datatype property for link speed and object properties for TopologyPlugin and TopologyParam.

